OL,3,GNEWSAFirms 'holding back' on new jobs
OL,4,Aahead of Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome businesses are calling for the
OL,7,Fcosts of employing staff to be brought
OL,8,Fdown in the Budget on Wednesday.
OL,10,FA publisher from Tavistock, Devon, said
OL,11,Fhe was "holding back" from filling two
OL,12,Fnew positions at his firm because of
OL,13,Fthe cost of taking on new employees.
OL,15,FAt the Devon Business Show some firms
OL,16,Fsaid they had been struggling for the
OL,17,Fpast two years to deal with the
OL,18,Fincreases in employers' National
OL,19,FInsurance contributions introduced in
OL,20,F2024, while also coping with increases
OL,21,Fin the National Minimum Wage.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
